<title>USA: TABLE - BJ'S WHOLESALE JULY STORE SALES UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BJ'S WHOLESALE JULY STORE SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $225	 $209	+7.5	 +2.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $1,447     $1,440	+8.0	 +1.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	4 weeks ended	August 2.</p>
<p>Full company name is  BJ's Wholesale Club Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: July same-store sales adversely affected by differences in staging of BJ's trial membership offer this year vs year-ago.</p>
